# China / RMB

**Buyers only.** Entry is the **China / RMB** pill on the top-right of the orange wallet balance card (web + app). Do not put this on Withdrawal.

## Buy RMB (Transfer to China)
User pays GHS → admin sends RMB to Alipay in China.
**Alipay only** for receiving in China. Do not add WeChat Pay to the Buy flow.

Admin configures:
- GHS → RMB transfer rate (`ghs_per_rmb`, selling/transfer rate to users)
- Fees, min/max, daily/monthly limits
- GHS payment methods (MoMo / bank)
- Dynamic form fields (recipient + payment proof)

## Sell RMB
User sells RMB to CityShop → receives USD or GHS.
Admin configures a separate **buying rate** (`usd_per_rmb` + `ghs_per_usd`), RMB receive methods (Alipay/WeChat), and dynamic form fields (payment + payout).

Statuses: Submitted → RMB Verification → RMB Received → Payout Processing → Paid → Completed.
Completing requires admin payout proof.

## App hub
China / RMB → **Exchange Type** cards: **GHS → RMB** (Ghana to China) | **RMB → GHS** (China to Ghana), then Continue. Keep rates independent so admin can set a spread.
